{"seq":4,"slug":"workflow-and-habits","title":"工作流与习惯","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/local-first-dev-environment/workflow-and-habits","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"task-runners-local-scripts","title":"任务运行器与本地脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/local-first-dev-environment/workflow-and-habits/task-runners-local-scripts","wordCount":2822,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"keeping-env-reproducible","title":"保持环境可复现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/local-first-dev-environment/workflow-and-habits/keeping-env-reproducible","wordCount":3076,"readingTime":13},{"seq":3,"slug":"local-first-and-offline","title":"本地优先与离线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/local-first-dev-environment/workflow-and-habits/local-first-and-offline","wordCount":3042,"readingTime":13}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工作流与习惯-简介\">工作流与习惯 简介</h1><p>工具配好只是基础，真正让环境发挥杠杆的是<strong>怎么用它、形成什么习惯</strong>。本章讲清把环境用出效率的工作流：先是<strong>任务运行器与本地脚本</strong>（用 Makefile/just 把项目常用操作收敛成一条命令、建个人脚本库 <code>~/bin</code> 沉淀重复操作），然后是<strong>保持环境可复现</strong>（把 setup 脚本化、记录手动步骤，让环境随时能在新机器重建而非靠记忆），最后是<strong>本地优先与离线</strong>（为什么优先用本地工具而非什么都上云——离线可用、速度、数据掌控）。把这些变成习惯，你的环境就从「一堆配置」变成「一套高效、可重建、随你走的工作方式」。</p>\n"}